# MATLAB editor/backup artifacts
*.asv
*.m~
slprj/
*.slxc

# Compiled MEX and object files -- wirSetup rebuilds ber_core from source,
# and a committed binary would be wrong for anyone on another platform.
*.mexw64
*.mexa64
*.mexmaci64
*.obj
*.o

# Generated data. The PNGs and the CSV ARE tracked: they are the artifact a
# reader looks at first. The .mat files are large intermediate state and are
# regenerated in ~3 minutes by analysis.runAll.
results/*.mat
